DrawOTag: route the OT-walk prim call through _ot_dispatch (same call, one site)

_ot_dispatch (re_out/dd2h_stubs.c) performs exactly the original indirect call
`_primfuncs[prim->type](prim, prev, ot)` (plus the existing relocation guard also
used by DrawPrim's DRAWPRIM-GUARD). Routing DrawOTag's inline dispatch through it
gives both targets ONE choke point for the whole render stream -- used by the
env-gated DD2_HIST per-frame prim histogram (bit-verify tooling vs tools/refhist.sh);
no behavioral change to the walk itself.

